            curr += 1
            res = max(res, streak)
        }

        return res
    }
}
```

::tabs-end

### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O(n \log n)$
- Space complexity: $O(1)$ or $O(n)$ depending on the sorting algorithm.

