### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O((n + m)\log k)$
- Space complexity:
    - $O(k)$ extra space.
    - $O(m)$ space for the output array.

> Where $m$ is the length of the array $queries$, $n$ is the length of the array $intervals$ and $k$ is the number of unique points.

