### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O(n ^ 3)$
- Space complexity:
    - $O(n)$ space for the hash map.
    - $O(m)$ space for the output array.

> Where $n$ is the size of the array $nums$ and $m$ is the number of quadruplets.

