- Time complexity: $O(n + k \log k)$
- Space complexity:
    - $O(1)$ or $O(k)$ space depending on the sorting algorithm.
    - $O(k)$ space for the output array.

> Where $n$ is the size of the input array and $k$ is the number of closest elements to find.

