        for (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
            suffix[i] = suffix[i + 1] + cardPoints[i];
        }

        int res = 0;
        for (int left = 0; left <= k; left++) {
            int right = k - left;
            res = Math.Max(res, prefix[left] + suffix[n - right]);
        }

        return res;
    }
}
```

::tabs-end

### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O(n)$
- Space complexity: $O(n)$

