## 1. Brute Force

::tabs-start

```python
class Solution:
    def rearrangeArray(self, nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:
        n = len(nums)
        for i in range(n):
            if ((i % 2 == 0 and nums[i] > 0) or
                (i % 2 == 1 and nums[i] < 0)):
                continue

            j = i + 1
            while j < n and ((nums[j] > 0) == (nums[i] > 0)):
                j += 1

            tmp = nums[j]
            while j > i:
                nums[j] = nums[j - 1]
                j -= 1
            nums[i] = tmp
        return nums
```

