### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O\left(\left(\max(|x|, |y|)\right)^2\right)$
- Space complexity: $O\left(\left(\max(|x|, |y|)\right)^2\right)$

>  Where $(x,y)$ is the coordinate of the target.

